# Example CODEOWNERS. Copy to .github/CODEOWNERS and replace the placeholders.
#
# This file is shipped as .example on purpose: committing a real CODEOWNERS with a guessed
# owner would silently request review from someone who never agreed to it.

# Default owner for everything.
# *                            @PLACEHOLDER-OWNER/maintainers

# Security-sensitive areas warrant a dedicated reviewer.
# /src/SharePointLinkManifestBuilder.Graph/Identity/    @PLACEHOLDER-OWNER/security
# /src/SharePointLinkManifestBuilder.Graph/Onboarding/  @PLACEHOLDER-OWNER/security
# /docs/THREAT-MODEL.md                                 @PLACEHOLDER-OWNER/security
# /SECURITY.md                                          @PLACEHOLDER-OWNER/security
# /scripts/scan-secrets.sh                              @PLACEHOLDER-OWNER/security
# /.github/workflows/                                   @PLACEHOLDER-OWNER/maintainers
